     pick only the firmware image for your network adapter choose one of the
     following:

           ddeevviiccee rrttwwnn--rrttll88118888eeeeffww
           ddeevviiccee rrttwwnn--rrttll88118888eeuuffww
           ddeevviiccee rrttwwnn--rrttll88119922ccffwwEE__BB
           ddeevviiccee rrttwwnn--rrttll88119922ccffwwEE
           ddeevviiccee rrttwwnn--rrttll88119922ccffwwTT
           ddeevviiccee rrttwwnn--rrttll88119922ccffwwUU
